data/chembl_dhfr/ecoli_dhfr_smiles.csv
    Records from ChEMBL (EMBL-EBI), target CHEMBL1809 (Escherichia coli
    dihydrofolate reductase), fetched on 2026-11-13 through the ChEMBL web
    services by scripts/fetch_chembl_dhfr.py and scripts/fetch_chembl_smiles.py.
    The ChEMBL release current at fetch time was not recorded.
    Licence: Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 3.0 Unported
    (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0/), as stated at
    https://www.ebi.ac.uk/chembl/ and
    https://chembl.gitbook.io/chembl-interface-documentation/about
    (checked 2026-11-17). Selected columns are kept and the rows are filtered;
    these three files, and anything derived from them alone, are shared under
    the same licence.
    Cite: Zdrazil B. et al. (2024) The ChEMBL Database in 2023. Nucleic Acids
    Res 52:D1180-D1192, doi:10.1093/nar/gkad1004.

data/frere2023_nitrocefin/*.csv
    Progress curves of P99 beta-lactamase hydrolysing nitrocefin, extracted by
    scripts/prepare_frere2023.py from the archive of Frere, Verlaine & Matagne
    (2023), Sci Rep 13:14994, doi:10.1038/s41598-023-41805-y, Zenodo
    doi:10.5281/zenodo.10059024.
    Licence: Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International
    (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/), per the Zenodo record
    https://zenodo.org/records/10059024 (checked 2026-11-17). Only the
    experimental CSVs are extracted; the instrument header is stripped and the
    time field's number format is converted, the readings are not altered.

data/pdb/*.pdb
